---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Adventure from "../content/images/page/about/Adventure.webp";
import heyjoacimeldre from "../content/images/page/about/heyjoacimeldre.svg";
import play from "../content/images/page/about/play.svg"

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About - Joacim Eldre"
    description="Joacim Eldre is a boy (guy?) who designs, adventure, and love most things yellow."
>
    <section>
        <div class="pt-16 max-w-xl2">
            <h1 class="typo-display-xl mb-4">
                I'm a boy, friend, dad, designer, adventurer, nerd, rainbow spewer, & human.
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                I like doing.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                Making. Designing. Drawing. Reading. Discovering. Building. Writing. Sharing. Helping. Playing. Learning. Trying. Adventuring. Laughing. Living. Loving.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                And I like solving problems.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
            The joy in figuring out why something doesn't work and fixing it, ideally so it's better than before. To fine-tune and adjust until it's just right, when it looks and feels good to use.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                Or inventing something that previously didn't exist.
            </p>
            <Image
                src={heyjoacimeldre}
                alt="A very accurate self portrait, me with big fluffy hair, drawing in the air with an Apple pencil."
                class="mt-8 w-70"
            />
            <p class="mt-8 typo-main">
                I'm formally educated as a visual and game designer. I feel at home with structure and limitation, in functional and practical systems. My strongest skill is visualization, to form written and spoken language into shapes. I'm a visual thinker who often fall into unicorn positions, the doers. I like unicorns, there’s something about different beings that make me curious, and I like curiosity.            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                During most week days I design (and configure and operate, this is the not fun part) software in public healthcare. I'm working on remote patient care, and patient flow inside the hospital.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                In my spare time I spend as much time as I can with family and friends, draw, play and make video games, use my hands on crafty things like knitting and sculpting, and go on adventures near and far.            </p>
            <Image
                src={Adventure}
                alt="A photo of my son and me on a hiking adventure in a forest, I've drawn a bunch doodles around us."
                title="My son and me on an adventure"
                class="mt-8 rounded-lg mx-auto"
            />
            <h2
                class="mt-8 typo-display-lg mb-4"
            >
                I really like
            </h2>
            <ul
                class="list-disc list-inside mt-6 typo-main space-y-2"
            >
                <li>design systems.</li>
                <li>visual design.</li>
                <!-- prettier-ignore -->
                <li><span class="inline-highlight inline-highlight-chip bg-accent-50" style="--selection-highlight: var(--color-accent-50);">yellow.</span></li>
                <li>patterns.</li>
                <li>listening to rain.</li>
                <li>drawing.</li>
                <li>video games.</li>
            </ul>
            <h2 class="mt-8 typo-display-lg mb-4">
                Play
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                My kids and I like to play, the ground is lava is a favourite. A fun way to get time and distance to pass! We step on small rocks and grass patches, and balance along fallen trees to stay alive.
            </p>
            <Image
                src={play}
                alt="A bunch of chunky lines in bright colors, a line ends where another line begins, a playful art piece."
                title="Be playful"
                class="mt-8 mx-auto"
            />
            <p class="mt-8 typo-main">
                Sometimes I make <a href="/tags/gameDevelopment">tiny video games</a> for my kids and me to play. They push me to have more fun. I love that! I think play is good for us, we should play a lot more. Be friendly to your inner child, it feels good.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
